' v1.2 Extended's bones and skulls (`preset extended ai amiga seed 5`, with
' and without `give item_skull`): into Sherwood and among its dogs, and a
' long wait. Without the skull they bite; with it none comes for him.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 13,124          ' into Sherwood
wait 60
mapclick 230,230         ' among the dogs
wait 3000
quit
